.TH SDL_HitTest 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_HitTest \- Callback used for hit-testing.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_video.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef SDL_HitTestResult (SDLCALL *SDL_HitTest)(SDL_Window *win, const SDL_Point *area, void *data);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I win
the
.BR SDL_Window
where hit-testing was set on\[char46]
.TP
.I area
an
.BR SDL_Point
which should be hit-tested\[char46]
.TP
.I data
what was passed as
.BR callback_data
to
.BR SDL_SetWindowHitTest ()\[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns an
.BR SDL_HitTestResult
value\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_SetWindowHitTest (3)
